    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483980/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1670244989\" /></div><br><br>Phi is a meditative adventure game. Play as Phi, a snake-like creature, navigating through an ancient ruin in search of lost souls to bring to their final resting place. Explore a cold, uncaring world and guide Phi to the light at the end of the tunnel.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483980/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1670244989\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tight controls. Squish and slide your way through the world!<br></li><li>Obstacles that toe the line between challenge and catharsis.<br></li><li>Beautiful minimal art that's pleasing to the eyes.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483980/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1670244989\" /></div><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483980/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1670244989\" /></div><br><br>Phi is a meditative adventure game. Play as Phi, a snake-like creature, navigating through an ancient ruin in search of lost souls to bring to their final resting place. Explore a cold, uncaring world and guide Phi to the light at the end of the tunnel.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483980/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1670244989\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tight controls. Squish and slide your way through the world!<br></li><li>Obstacles that toe the line between challenge and catharsis.<br></li><li>Beautiful minimal art that's pleasing to the eyes.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1483980/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1670244989\" /></div><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
